# R47-A fix (ROUND47 P0): Allow esbuild postinstall during npm install.
# Root cause: npm 10+ "allow-scripts" blocks esbuild postinstall by default.
# Fix: start_mvp.py uses "npm install --allow-scripts" to explicitly allow.
# This .npmrc is kept as documentation; the actual fix is in start_mvp.py.
# Note: esbuild postinstall (node install.js) downloads platform binary
# (@esbuild/win32-x64/esbuild.exe) which is required for vite build.
